1
00:00:12,432 --> 00:00:18,668
Excusez-moi, madame. Où est la gare, s'il vous plaît ?
Excuse me, madam. Where is the station, please?

2
00:00:18,768 --> 00:00:23,156
La gare ? Allez tout droit.
The station? Go straight ahead.

3
00:00:23,256 --> 00:00:27,212
Puis tournez à gauche après la boulangerie.
Then turn left after the bakery.

4
00:00:27,312 --> 00:00:29,684
C'est loin ?
Is it far?

5
00:00:29,784 --> 00:00:33,572
Non, c'est à cinq minutes à pied.
No, it's five minutes on foot.

6
00:00:33,672 --> 00:00:36,140
Et la poste ?
And the post office?

7
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:40,700
La poste est à côté de la gare, à droite.
The post office is next to the station, on the right.

8
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:44,252
Merci beaucoup, madame !
Thank you very much, madam!

9
00:00:44,352 --> 00:00:47,636
De rien, bonne journée !
You're welcome, have a nice day!
